":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p029","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m031-0063","start":63,"end":66,"surface":"楚共王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001886","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p031","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m039-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"共王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001886","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p039","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-shiji040-034","subject_person_id":"cbr-p001886","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"cbr-p001885","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p025","quote":"二十年，圍宋，以殺楚使也。圍宋五月，城中食盡，易子而食，析骨而炊。宋華元出告以情。莊王曰：「君子哉！」遂罷兵去。二十三年，莊王卒，子共王審立。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"子／其子","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"依本段明示生育、兄弟、母子及苗裔敘事；祖先不作直接父親，繼位不自動推父子，不補未見母名或闕代。來源主張不等於版本與史實已覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji040-035","subject_person_id":"cbr-p001887","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"cbr-p001886","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p027","quote":"三十一年，共王卒，子康王招立。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"子／其子","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"依本段明示生育、兄弟、母子及苗裔敘事；祖先不作直接父親，繼位不自動推父子，不補未見母名或闕代。來源主張不等於版本與史實已覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji040-042","subject_person_id":"cbr-p001887","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"cbr-p001886","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p039","quote":"初，共王有寵子五人，無適立，乃望祭群神，請神決之，使主社稷，而陰與巴姬埋璧於室内，召五公子齋而入。康王跨之，靈王肘加之，子比、子皙皆遠之。平王幼，抱其上而拜，壓紐。故康王以長立，至其子失之；圍爲靈王，及身而弒；子比爲王十餘日，子皙不得立，又倶誅。四子皆絶無後。唯獨棄疾後立，爲平王，竟續楚祀，如其神符。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"共王有寵子五人","historicity":"histo