892","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"cbr-p001886","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p039","quote":"初，共王有寵子五人，無適立，乃望祭群神，請神決之，使主社稷，而陰與巴姬埋璧於室内，召五公子齋而入。康王跨之，靈王肘加之，子比、子皙皆遠之。平王幼，抱其上而拜，壓紐。故康王以長立，至其子失之；圍爲靈王，及身而弒；子比爲王十餘日，子皙不得立，又倶誅。四子皆絶無後。唯獨棄疾後立，爲平王，竟續楚祀，如其神符。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"共王有寵子五人","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"依本段明示生育、兄弟、母子及苗裔敘事；祖先不作直接父親，繼位不自動推父子，不補未見母名或闕代。來源主張不等於版本與史實已覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji040-017","person_id":"cbr-p001886","surfaces":["共王","共王審","楚共王","王"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-040-chu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p025","quote":"二十年，圍宋，以殺楚使也。圍宋五月，城中食盡，易子而食，析骨而炊。宋華元出告以情。莊王曰：「君子哉！」遂罷兵去。二十三年，莊王卒，子共王審立。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p026","quote":"共王十六年，晉伐鄭。鄭告急，共王救鄭。與晉兵戰鄢陵，晉敗楚，射中共王目。共王召將軍子反。子反嗜酒，從者豎陽穀進酒醉。王怒，射殺子反，遂罷兵歸。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p027","quote":"三十一年，共王卒，子康王招立。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p029","quote":"康王寵弟公子圍、子比、子皙、棄疾。郟敖三年，以其季父康王弟公子圍爲令尹，主兵事。四年，圍使鄭，道聞王疾而還。十二月己酉，圍入問王疾，絞而弒之，遂殺其子莫及平夏。使使赴於鄭。伍舉問曰：「誰爲後？」對曰：「寡大夫圍。」伍舉更曰：「共王之子圍爲長。」子比奔晉，而圍立，是爲靈王。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p031","quote":"七月，楚以諸侯兵伐呉，圍朱方。八月，克之，囚慶封，滅其族。以封徇，曰：「無效齊慶封弒其君而弱其孤，以盟諸大夫！」封反曰：「莫如楚共王庶子圍弒其君兄之子員而代之立！」於是靈王使（棄）疾殺之。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p039","quote":"初，共王有寵子五人，無適立，乃望祭群神，請神決之，使主社稷，而陰與巴姬埋璧於室内，召五公子齋而入。康王跨之，靈王肘加之，子比、子皙皆遠之。平王幼，抱其上而拜，壓紐。故康王以長立，至其子失之；圍爲靈王，及身而弒；子比爲王十餘日，子皙不得立，又倶誅。四子皆絶無後。唯獨棄疾後立，爲平王，竟續楚祀，如其神符。"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示是為、改名、親屬與連續事件暫接，僅適用列示段落；不同篇候選未自動合併，追稱不當授予日期。 第26段王怒射殺子反接共王主語。 僅限本次列出的敘事與引語，版本及匿名指代覆核未完成。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p025","text":"二十年，圍宋，以殺楚使也。圍宋五月，城中食盡，易子而食，析骨而炊。宋華元出告以情。莊王曰：「君子哉！」遂罷兵去。二十三年，莊王卒，子共王審立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m025-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"楚使","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"因殺楚使而圍宋的未名使者，待與宋篇核對，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m025-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"宋華元","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001658","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m025-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001885","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m025-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001885","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m025-0066","start":66,"end":69,"surface":"共王審","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001886","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p026","text":"共王十六年，晉伐鄭。鄭告急，共王救鄭。與晉兵戰鄢陵，晉敗楚，射中共王目。共王召將軍子反。子反嗜酒，從者豎陽穀進酒醉。王怒，射殺子反，遂罷兵歸。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m026-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"共王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001886","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m026-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"共王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001886","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m026-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"共王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001886","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m026-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"共王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001886","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m026-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"子反","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001978","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m026-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"子反","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001978","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m026-0051","start":51,"end":54,"surface":"豎陽穀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001979","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m026-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001886","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m026-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"子反","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001978","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p027","text":"三十一年，共王卒，子康王招立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m027-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"共王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001886","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m027-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"康王招","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001887","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p029","text":"康王寵弟公子圍、子比、子皙、棄疾。郟敖三年，以其季父康王弟公子圍爲令尹，主兵事。四年，圍使鄭，道聞王疾而還。十二月己酉，圍入問王疾，絞而弒之，遂殺其子莫及平夏。使使赴於鄭。伍舉問曰：「誰爲後？」對曰：「寡大夫圍。」伍舉更曰：「共王之子圍爲長。」子比奔晉，而圍立，是爲靈王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m029-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"康王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001887","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m029-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"公子圍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001889","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m029-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"子比","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001890","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m029-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"子皙","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001891","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m029-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"棄疾","kind"